{"w":2400,"h":3396,"lines":[{"h":0.016374753136516929,"x":0.83484891321897259,"y":0.035148635092982272,"w":0.081507116953531855,"t":"Reading","c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.73662551879882809,"c":1,"y":0.082744405231998996,"t":"The medical benefits of the polar bear for humanity certainly have their importance in our","x":0.078189298121741704},{"y":0.10029069752609399,"h":0.016022611984235047,"t":"conservation efforts, but these should not be the only factors taken into consideration. We tend to","x":0.076131676579290014,"w":0.79218109130859393,"c":1},{"w":0.8314231872558594,"t":"want to protect animals we think are intelligent and possess emotions, such as elephants and primates.","h":0.021259314601075996,"c":1,"x":0.078122124054750844,"y":0.11615857471129043},{"t":"Bears, on the other hand, seem to be perceived as stupid and in many cases violent. And yet anecdotal","y":0.13662790683107384,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.0781892921457603,"w":0.83127573649088538},{"x":0.076131681800817433,"h":0.017506916756062751,"w":0.81275721232096354,"y":0.15400471130530169,"t":"evidence from the field challenges those assumptions, suggesting for example that polar bears have","c":1},{"h":0.018987797174352616,"c":1,"w":0.78189300537109374,"x":0.078189301388527116,"t":"good problem-solving abilities. A male bear called GoGo in Tennoji Zoo, Osaka, has even been","y":0.17005813973777606},{"c":1,"t":"observed making use of a tool to manipulate his environment. The bear used a tree branch on multiple","w":0.83539093017578137,"y":0.19040697659834871,"x":0.078189308479009678,"h":0.016012340046912987},{"y":0.20784883706336088,"t":"occasions to dislodge a piece of meat hung out of his reach. Problem-solving ability has also been","x":0.078189296856755283,"w":0.80041152954101569,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.8230452473958334,"x":0.078189310374656318,"y":0.22526501740418414,"t":"witnessed in wild polar bears, although not as obviously as with GoGo. A calculated move by a male","h":0.016014052504504717},{"w":0.82098765055338541,"y":0.24263839808678633,"h":0.017667844522968212,"t":"bear involved running and jumping onto barrels in an attempt to get to a photographer standing on a","x":0.076131689019853371,"c":1},{"y":0.26148409914083892,"t":"platform four metres high.","w":0.22222221374511719,"h":0.016195524146054074,"c":1,"x":0.076131691379509425},{"x":0.076131675523409964,"w":0.79835393269856769,"y":0.2965116277479849,"t":"In other studies, such as one by Alison Ames in 2008, polar bears showed deliberate and focussed","h":0.017441860778592999,"c":1},{"w":0.84156377156575524,"t":"manipulation. For example, Ames observed bears putting objects in piles and then knocking them over","h":0.018968964072363481,"x":0.076131694507245884,"c":1,"y":0.31242638435410464},{"x":0.076079745700743426,"y":0.33097356304328218,"t":"in what appeared to be a game. The study demonstrates that bears are capable of agile and thought-out","w":0.84167170206705733,"c":1,"h":0.019202448032770159},{"c":1,"x":0.078189311294275116,"t":"behaviours. These examples suggest bears have greater creativity and problem-solving abilities than","y":0.35029069752866537,"w":0.81687240600585953,"h":0.016022611984234936},{"t":"previously thought.","w":0.1604938252766927,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.07818930126959453,"y":0.36773255798105398,"c":1},{"y":0.40253239095417803,"c":1,"t":"As for emotions, while the evidence is once again anecdotal, many bears have been seen to hit out","w":0.80246912638346357,"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.078189305026691802},{"x":0.076131680847374997,"t":"at ice and snow - seemingly out of frustration - when they have just missed out on a kill. Moreover,","w":0.81893005371093752,"h":0.017515476797438589,"c":1,"y":0.42005813937554215},{"w":0.81275721232096354,"y":0.4389534882263344,"c":1,"h":0.015993508068214979,"x":0.078189294973616749,"t":"polar bears can form unusual relationships with other species, including playing with the dogs used"},{"w":0.80246912638346346,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.076131691857712361,"y":0.45639534869114617,"t":"to pull sleds in the Arctic. Remarkably, one hand-raised polar bear called Agee has formed a close"},{"h":0.016032884483202614,"w":0.80452677408854179,"x":0.076131674578885228,"y":0.47379269705353244,"c":1,"t":"relationship with her owner Mark Dumas to the point where they even swim together. This is even"},{"y":0.49011852175630966,"x":0.078086756925557138,"t":"more astonishing since polar bears are known to actively hunt humans in the wild.","w":0.67301574707031253,"h":0.019536569907611878,"c":1},{"y":0.52598221866367656,"c":1,"w":0.78404047648111974,"h":0.018903837889187147,"t":"If climate change were to lead to their extinction, this would mean not only the loss of potential","x":0.076095179292515247},{"t":"breakthroughs in human medicine, but more importantly, the disappearance of an intelligent,","x":0.078189302504860531,"h":0.017446996466430997,"y":0.5450530036876805,"w":0.7633744812011718,"c":1},{"t":"majestic animal.","y":0.56187547511012048,"w":0.14048625946044924,"c":1,"h":0.017096094866102307,"x":0.075805104286885125},{"t":"17","y":0.90697674401398698,"x":0.8909465021607732,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.024691357612609877}]}